{"unit_id":"hotpot-labs__dsh-version-plugin#card-zh","repo":"hotpot-labs/dsh-version-plugin","commit":"f751fdf0bca5c2d1be50d8792eba7459ff3125d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-version-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的版本管理插件，会在设置弹窗的通用设置底部加入版本信息行。它在主机端读取当前安装的 DSH 版本，并通过 RPC 查询 npm 上的最新版本或运行更新命令。用户可以查看当前版本、检查最新版本、比较是否已是最新版，并将全局安装的 DSH 更新到最新版本，界面会显示操作状态和命令结果。适合希望直接从 Web 设置查看并维护全局 DSH 安装的用户。无需 API 密钥；检查更新会访问 npm registry，更新功能要求本机有 npm。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:118-168","src/client.tsx:64-129","cordis.patch.yml:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"hotpot-labs__dsh-version-plugin#card-en","repo":"hotpot-labs/dsh-version-plugin","commit":"f751fdf0bca5c2d1be50d8792eba7459ff3125d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-version-plugin adds a version row to General Settings in DSH Web. It reads the installed version and can check npm for the latest release or update the global DSH package. Users can see both versions, update status, and command output. No API key is needed; updating requires npm.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:118-168","src/client.tsx:64-129","cordis.patch.yml:1-4"]}
